              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-37730",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2025-37730\nSeverity: MEDIUM\nPackage: logstash-output-tcp\nFixed Version: ~\u003e 6.2.2, \u003e= 7.0.1\nLink: [CVE-2025-37730](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-37730)\nImproper certificate validation in Logstash's TCP output could lead to a man-in-the-middle (MitM) attack in “client” mode, as hostname verification in TCP output was not being performed when the ssl_verification_mode =\u003e full was set.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2025-37730**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|MEDIUM|logstash-output-tcp|~\u003e 6.2.2, \u003e= 7.0.1|[CVE-2025-37730](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-37730)|\n\nImproper certificate validation in Logstash's TCP output could lead to a man-in-the-middle (MitM) attack in “client” mode, as hostname verification in TCP output was not being performed when the ssl_verification_mode =\u003e full was set."
